<title>USA: TeleBanc Financial Q3 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>TeleBanc Financial Q3 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.03   profit	 $0.27</p>
<p> Net loss			62   profit	   549</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.63   profit	 $0.67</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,347   profit	 1,379</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is TeleBanc Financial Corp.</p>
<p>The company said net income for both 1996 periods was impacted by a $1.7 million special SAIF assessment charge.</p>
